lication dates, and how the authors framed the trial stops.", "findings": [{"claim": "No results publication found for trial NCT03521232. Three articles were found that only mention the trial or predate it.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:none:nct03521232"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Searched snapshot and live PubMed/Europe PMC via find_publications."}, {"claim": "No results publication found for trial NCT04839575. Four articles were found that only mention the trial or predate it.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:none:nct04839575"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Searched snapshot and live PubMed/Europe PMC via find_publications."}, {"claim": "No results publication found for trial NCT04243551. Five articles were found that only mention the trial or predate it.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:none:nct04243551"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Searched snapshot and live PubMed/Europe PMC via find_publications."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "trials", "round": 2, "brief": "Analyze the registry status, completion dates, and results-reporting history for Entero Therapeutics (First Wave BioPharma) trials NCT03521232, NCT04839575, and NCT04243551. Confirm the official why_stopped reasons, trial phase, actual completion or termination dates, and verify whether any results have been posted to ClinicalTrials.gov.\n\n(Gap to close: Trials lane failed in round 1 due to API rate limits and must be retried to obtain official registry details.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT03521232 (A Study of Niclosamide Enemas in Subjects With Active Ulcerative Proctitis or Ulcerative Proctosigmoiditis) is Phase 1/Phase 2, overall status TERMINATED, start date 2018-05-15, primary completion date 2022-09-19, and completion date 2022-10-04, with an enrollment of 27.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT03521232"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed via live registry record matching snapshot."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT03521232 was stopped with the official why_stopped reason \"Covid-19\" (category: other). 